# WISIPAY PERFORMANCE METRICS LOG (SAMPLE / DUMMY DATA — FOR ASSESSMENT USE ONLY)
# This file captures system-level performance data for each transaction attempt
# processed by the WisiPay backend. One row per provider call attempt.
#
# Format per line:
#   REQ_TIMESTAMP | TXN_ID=... | ENDPOINT=... | HTTP_STATUS=... | LATENCY_MS=... | RETRY_COUNT=... | QUEUE_WAIT_MS=... | RESP_TIMESTAMP=...
#
# Fields:
#   REQ_TIMESTAMP   — Timestamp when WisiPay sent the request to the provider
#   TXN_ID          — Matches the TXN_ID in transactions.log
#   ENDPOINT        — Internal WisiPay routing endpoint used for this attempt
#   HTTP_STATUS     — HTTP status code returned to the WisiPay backend
#   LATENCY_MS      — Provider round-trip latency in milliseconds
#   RETRY_COUNT     — Attempt number (0 = first attempt, 1 = first retry, etc.)
#   QUEUE_WAIT_MS   — Time the request spent in WisiPay's internal queue before dispatch
#   RESP_TIMESTAMP  — Timestamp when WisiPay received the provider response
#
# ENDPOINT REFERENCE:
#   /api/v2/payment/upi       — NPCI UPI rail
#   /api/v2/payment/pg/razorpay  — Razorpay gateway
#   /api/v2/payment/pg/payu      — PayU gateway
#   /api/v2/payment/pg/hdfc      — HDFC PG
#   /api/v2/payment/pg/axis      — Axis Bank PG
#   /api/v2/payment/pg/icici     — ICICI Bank PG
#   /api/v2/payment/pg/kotak     — Kotak Mahindra PG

